Subject: [PATCH] ggml-metal: add TQ2_0 kernels (upstream #12485 rewrite)

Rebase old ggml-metal.m PR onto modern pipeline lookup: dequant,
mul_mv (FC_mul_mv), get_rows, mul_mm/mul_mm_id, mul_mv_id.
